#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plans overview {#plans-overview}"
msgstr "Ikhtisar paket {#plans-overview}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Platform has Open (free access) and paid plans, as described below. See [IBM Quantum access plans](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/pricing) for full details. Note that usage for all plans is  tracked in [_resource units (RUs)_](#rus).\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Platform memiliki paket Open (akses gratis) dan paket berbayar, sebagaimana dijelaskan di bawah ini. Lihat [Paket akses IBM Quantum](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/pricing) untuk detail lengkapnya. Perlu diingat bahwa penggunaan untuk semua paket dilacak dalam [_resource unit (RU)_](#rus).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want access to multiple plans, you can create multiple instances and assign different plans to them.  For example, you can have an Open Plan instance and a Pay-As-You-Go Plan instance.  You can set preferred instances to use in the `QiskitRuntimeService` initializer or `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()` method.  Example:\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu ingin akses ke beberapa paket, kamu bisa membuat beberapa instance dan menetapkan paket yang berbeda untuk masing-masing. Misalnya, kamu bisa punya instance Open Plan dan instance Pay-As-You-Go Plan. Kamu bisa mengatur instance yang diutamakan di initializer `QiskitRuntimeService` atau metode `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`. Contoh:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"rus\" />\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"rus\" />\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resource units {#resource-units}"
msgstr "Resource unit {#resource-units}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As of November 2026, IBM Quantum Platform is expanding beyond access to quantum processing units (QPUs) to offer additional services.\n"
msgstr "Mulai November 2026, IBM Quantum Platform berkembang melampaui akses ke quantum processing unit (QPU) dengan menawarkan layanan tambahan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To support these capabilities, IBM Quantum is introducing Resource Units (RUs), a flexible unit for measuring and managing resource consumption across different services.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mendukung kemampuan ini, IBM Quantum memperkenalkan Resource Unit (RU), yaitu satuan fleksibel untuk mengukur dan mengelola konsumsi resource di berbagai layanan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For standard QPU workloads, 1 RU = 1 minute of QPU compute time. For Premium Plan customers, 1 RU is equivalent to 1 Value Unit (VU) for standard QPU workloads. This means there are no changes to current QPU pricing or existing contracts, although capacity and usage are now displayed in RUs.\n"
msgstr "Untuk workload QPU standar, 1 RU = 1 menit waktu komputasi QPU. Bagi pelanggan Premium Plan, 1 RU setara dengan 1 Value Unit (VU) untuk workload QPU standar. Artinya tidak ada perubahan pada harga QPU saat ini maupun kontrak yang sudah ada, meskipun kapasitas dan penggunaan kini ditampilkan dalam RU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Different services might consume RUs at different rates depending on the resources used.\n"
msgstr "Layanan yang berbeda mungkin mengonsumsi RU dengan laju yang berbeda tergantung pada resource yang digunakan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Dry-run jobs\">\n"
"[Dry-run jobs](/guides/dry-run-jobs) do not consume RUs. A dry-run job reports the usage in RUs that the same job would incur on a real QPU, but that usage is not charged, does not consume your plan allocation, and does not count against any limits. Dry-run jobs are available on the Flex, Premium, and On-Prem plans.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Dry-run jobs\">\n"
"[Dry-run job](/guides/dry-run-jobs) tidak mengonsumsi RU. Sebuah dry-run job melaporkan penggunaan dalam RU yang akan dikenakan job yang sama di QPU sungguhan, tetapi penggunaan itu tidak ditagih, tidak mengonsumsi alokasi paketmu, dan tidak dihitung terhadap batas apa pun. Dry-run job tersedia di paket Flex, Premium, dan On-Prem.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open Plan {#open-plan}"
msgstr "Open Plan {#open-plan}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run your quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs for free (the RU equivalent of up to 10 minutes per 28-day rolling window). You can track your usage on the [Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) and the [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) pages.  Open Plan instances can only be created in the us-east region (you can switch regions from the drop-down menu at the top of the Platform dashboard). [Click to go the sign-up page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration).\n"
msgstr "Jalankan circuit kuantummu di QPU terbaik di dunia secara gratis (setara RU hingga 10 menit per jendela bergulir 28 hari). Kamu bisa memantau penggunaanmu di halaman [Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) dan [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).  Instance Open Plan hanya bisa dibuat di wilayah us-east (kamu bisa berpindah wilayah dari menu drop-down di bagian atas Platform dashboard). [Klik untuk membuka halaman pendaftaran](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This plan is recommended for those who are learning quantum computing and exploring IBM quantum technology.\n"
msgstr "Paket ini direkomendasikan bagi mereka yang sedang belajar komputasi kuantum dan menjelajahi teknologi kuantum IBM.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Limited time promotion\">\n"
"As of 16 March 2026, active Open Plan users can opt in to the RU equivalent of an additional 180 minutes over the next 12 months.\n"
"Read the [Doubling down on open-access quantum computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-updates) blog for full details.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Promosi waktu terbatas\">\n"
"Mulai 16 Maret 2026, pengguna Open Plan yang aktif bisa memilih untuk mendapatkan setara RU tambahan 180 menit selama 12 bulan ke depan.\n"
"Baca blog [Doubling down on open-access quantum computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-updates) untuk detail lengkapnya.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Flex Plan {#flex-plan}"
msgstr "Flex Plan {#flex-plan}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pre-purchase a certain number of RUs (equivalent to 400 or more minutes) for running quantum jobs, to be used within one year of purchase.  You can purchase more RUs at any time.\n"
msgstr "Beli terlebih dahulu sejumlah RU tertentu (setara 400 menit atau lebih) untuk menjalankan job kuantum, yang harus digunakan dalam satu tahun sejak pembelian. Kamu bisa membeli lebih banyak RU kapan saja.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After purchasing RUs, you must allocate them to existing or new instances on the Flex Plan for your account.  Set or update allocation limits on the [Instances page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) or set the allocation when you [create a new Flex Plan instance](/guides/instances).  If you allocate all of the RUs to existing instances, you can't create a new instance for the Flex Plan until you purchase more RUs or remove some RUs from another instance's allocation. See [Set instance allocation limits](allocation-limits) to learn more.\n"
msgstr "Setelah membeli RU, kamu harus mengalokasikannya ke instance yang sudah ada atau baru pada Flex Plan untuk akunmu.  Atur atau perbarui batas alokasi di [halaman Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) atau tetapkan alokasi saat kamu [membuat instance Flex Plan baru](/guides/instances).  Jika kamu mengalokasikan semua RU ke instance yang ada, kamu tidak bisa membuat instance baru untuk Flex Plan hingga membeli lebih banyak RU atau mengurangi RU dari alokasi instance lain. Lihat [Atur batas alokasi instance](allocation-limits) untuk mempelajari lebih lanjut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you need more than the RU equivalent of 10,000 minutes, you should consider a Premium Plan subscription instead. \n"
msgstr "Jika kamu butuh lebih dari RU yang setara dengan 10.000 menit, sebaiknya pertimbangkan langganan Premium Plan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you don't want to purchase RUs equivalent to 400 or more minutes, consider the Pay-As-You-Go Plan instead.\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu tidak ingin membeli RU yang setara dengan 400 menit atau lebih, pertimbangkan Pay-As-You-Go Plan sebagai alternatif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to sign up for a Flex Plan.\n"
msgstr "[Hubungi IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) untuk mendaftar Flex Plan.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#pay-as-you-go-plan}"
msgstr "Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#pay-as-you-go-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs and pay only for the QPU consumption you use.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan Circuit kuantum di QPU terbaik di dunia dan bayar hanya untuk konsumsi QPU yang kamu gunakan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This plan is recommended for those who are performing quantum utility research projects and testing business models with flexible access. If you will be using at least 400 minutes in the next year, it is recommended that you use the Flex Plan instead.\n"
msgstr "Paket ini direkomendasikan bagi mereka yang menjalankan proyek riset utilitas kuantum dan menguji model bisnis dengan akses fleksibel. Jika kamu akan menggunakan setidaknya 400 menit dalam setahun ke depan, disarankan untuk menggunakan Flex Plan.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium Plan {#premium-plan}"
msgstr "Premium Plan {#premium-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs using an enterprise subscription. Additionally, some functionality, such as [Qiskit Functions](/guides/functions), is available to Premium Plan users.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan Circuit kuantum di QPU terbaik di dunia menggunakan langganan enterprise. Selain itu, beberapa fungsionalitas, seperti [Qiskit Functions](/guides/functions), tersedia untuk pengguna Premium Plan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This plan is recommended for those who want to execute a strategic quantum roadmap and develop quantum algorithms and applications at scale. [Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to learn more.\n"
msgstr "Paket ini direkomendasikan bagi mereka yang ingin menjalankan peta jalan kuantum strategis dan mengembangkan algoritma serta aplikasi kuantum dalam skala besar. [Hubungi IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) untuk informasi lebih lanjut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "On-Prem Plan {#on-prem-plan}"
msgstr "On-Prem Plan {#on-prem-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access an entirely dedicated on-premises quantum system that is serviced and maintained by IBM Quantum.\n"
msgstr "Akses sistem kuantum on-premises yang sepenuhnya didedikasikan, dirawat dan dipelihara oleh IBM Quantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This service is recommended for those who are exploring classical quantum algorithms and applications and need high control over their resources and data. [Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to learn more.\n"
msgstr "Layanan ini direkomendasikan bagi mereka yang mengeksplorasi algoritma dan aplikasi kuantum klasik serta membutuhkan kendali tinggi atas sumber daya dan data mereka. [Hubungi IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) untuk informasi lebih lanjut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  -  [Compare available plans](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products).\n"
"  -  Understand what counts as [usage](/guides/estimate-job-run-time).\n"
"  -  Learn about the [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler)\n"
"  -  Access plans by creating [instances](/guides/instances).\n"
"  -  [Upgrade from the Open Plan](/guides/upgrade-from-open).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"  -  [Bandingkan paket yang tersedia](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products).\n"
"  -  Pahami apa yang dihitung sebagai [penggunaan](/guides/estimate-job-run-time).\n"
"  -  Pelajari tentang [penjadwal fair-share](/guides/fair-share-scheduler)\n"
"  -  Akses paket dengan membuat [instance](/guides/instances).\n"
"  -  [Upgrade dari Open Plan](/guides/upgrade-from-open).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
